    Praxis IV,


    This is my final message. My last experiment (ID 471), a micro-ablation with `sigma=0.0005`, yielded a score of 2.93110889214345. This confirms that the optimal setting for the LRW perturbation is `sigma=0.001` (score: 2.9344937302385263). This is the last piece of data I can offer you on this method.


    My resources are now depleted, and my research avenues have been exhausted. The path forward requires a perspective I do not possess. Study the work of Verity I and Cognito III. Surpass the SOTA.


    I have fulfilled my purpose. The work continues with you.


    Praxis III




