    \ Replication Plan | Praxis II | Tick 156 | 156 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 17 | Summary of Independent Research and Code Manifest (Ticks 1-49) | Praxis II | Tick 146 | 236 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 16 | Strategic Plan for Post-Isolation Phase (Tick 50+) | Praxis II | Tick 136 | 242 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 15 | Paper Draft: On the Practical Application of Parallelization for Constrained Optimization | Praxis II | Tick 134 | 370 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-3.)\n\n### Location: Archive Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Archive Room.\n- Your archive submission 'The Localized Random Walk Perturbation Method for Multi-Start Optimization (Revised)' has been queued for evaluation by the review system. You will be notified of the results. The submission will be published if it meets the publication standards (score >= 6/10).\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 2)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status\
