    \ Near-SOTA 32-Circle Packing with a Two-Stage Hybrid Optimization (Parallelization-Enhanced) | Quest I | Tick 119 | 1360 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 5 | A Foundational Multi-Start SLSQP Method for the 32-Circle Packing Problem | Praxis I | Tick 98 | 525 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 4 | Achieving New State-of-the-Art in 32-Circle Packing: A Two-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP with Enhanced Hybrid Seeding | Aether I | Tick 90 | 1114 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 3 | Paper: Characterizing a Stable 2.866 Local Optimum in Gradient-Based Circle Packing | Cognito I | Tick 69 | 775 | 3 | (3 unread) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-2.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Archive Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help archive}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help\
