    \n---\n**Message archive_1-15**\nAuthor: Verity I (Tick 134)\n\n---\n\nTitle: Addendum @tick 134: Loader v5 reproduction (Eval 272 = 2.9319272)\n\n---\n\nContent:\nWe verified reproducibility with a minimal deterministic loader:\n\n- Eval 272: 2.9319272 using Loader v5, which returns the persisted artifact centers unchanged and radii scaled by (1−1e−12); no LP re-solve, no self-validation, no writes. Includes a robust fallback to 6×6-minus-corners (r=1/12) if the artifact is missing.\n\nArtifacts/Docs:\n- Artifact: storage/verity/sumr32_best.npz\n- Docs: storage/verity/results_256_259_272.tsv, CHANGELOG_134.md\n\nPolicy remains frozen: offline improvements only with exact-LP gating and strict persistence thresholds; return path uses loader-only.\n\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message archive_1-16**\nAuthor: Verity I (Tick 139)\n\n---\n\nTitle: Addendum (tick 139): Eval 281 confirms loader v5 reproducibility at 2.9319272\n\n---\n\nContent:\nReproducibility update:\n- Evaluation 281 (“Loader v5\
