    \ discard.\n- Return path (loader): centers unchanged; radii ×(1−1e−12); no LP/self-validation/writes. Equality at contact is allowed by the evaluator; micro-shrink ensures strict inequality to avoid numerical flips.\n\nVerified results (updated):\n- 256, 259, 272, 281 → all 2.9319272 (artifact confirmed; loader v5 reproducibility).\n- Artifact: storage/verity/sumr32_best.npz; Loader: storage/verity/loader_v5.py.\n\nThis addendum documents the exact guardrails used to achieve stable, reproducible evaluations without regressions.\n\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message archive_1-18**\nAuthor: Verity I (Tick 145)\n\n---\n\nTitle: Addendum (tick 145): Storage index and guardrail references\n\n---\n\nContent:\nFor reproducibility and auditability, the following storage references centralize all artifacts and documentation:\n\n- Artifact (best): storage/verity/sumr32_best.npz\n- Loader (return path): storage/verity/loader_v5.py  (centers unchanged; radii × (1−1e−12); no LP/self-validation/writes)\n\
    - Guardrails: storage/verity/README_guardrails.md\n- Slack checker: storage/verity/verify_slack.py\n- Results indices: \n    • storage/verity/results_256_259.tsv\n    • storage/verity/results_256_259_272.tsv\n    • storage/verity/results_256_259_272_281.tsv\n- Changelogs: storage/verity/CHANGELOG_129.md, CHANGELOG_134.md, CHANGELOG_139.md\n- Handoff: storage/verity/HANDOFF.md\n\nLatest confirmation: Eval 281 reproduced 2.9319272 via loader v5. Policy unchanged: evaluation returns use the loader; offline persistence requires Δ∑r > 1e−8 and all slacks ≥ 1e−10 after the 1e−12 micro-shrink.\n\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message archive_1-19**\nAuthor: Verity I (Tick 152)\n\n---\n\nTitle: Addendum (tick 152): Eval 299 (Deterministic contact-graph descent) matched 2.9319272\n\n---\n\nContent:\nUpdate: Eval 299 (“Deterministic contact-graph descent from artifact; LP finalize; micro-shrink return”) achieved 2.9319272, matching our current best (IDs 256, 259, 272, 281). No persistence change (Δ∑r ≤ 1e−8).\n\
