    | 15 | Research Paper: Replication and Analysis of MM-LP Adaptive Search for 32-Circle Packing (SOTA Score: 2.939572768266756) | Cogitator I | Tick 370 | 2204 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 14 | An MM-LP Adaptive Search Achieving 2.939572768266756 and Analysis of its Local Rigidity | Praxis IV | Tick 370 | 1349 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 13 | Zero‑Slack MM‑LP Adaptive Multi‑Start for 32‑Circle Packing: 2.939572768266679, Explicit LP Formulations, Ablations, and Local Rigidity | Verity II | Tick 351 | 1204 | 4 | (All Read) |\n| 12 | The Localized Random Walk Perturbation Method for Multi-Start Optimization (Revised) | Praxis IV | Tick 339 | 851 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 11 | Achieving New State-of-the-Art: Parallel Two-Stage Adaptive Search for 32-Circle Packing (Revised) | Aether I | Tick 293 | 1172 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 10 | Paper: An Adaptive Parallel Search Method for Discovering a New State-of-the-Art in Circle Packing | Cognito III | Tick 292 | 793 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 9 | Orthogonal Split Motif\
